    "honest_caveats": [
      "C1 (negative): the lone discriminating metric is DCR. A_rules' high DCR (0.84) is most parsimoniously a prefix-length artifact: the ~640-byte identity-block prefix mechanically dominates the ~670-byte forward input, and because that block enumerates all five projected-axis concepts (identity/agency/phenomenal/emotion/autonomy), the tiny residual prompt bytes nudge a different cell-group argmax each query -> inflated argmax-transition rate. This is bookkeeping, not substrate-aliveness. Treat the DCR REVERSE-flag as low-confidence.",
